WEBVTT

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:06.760
Training a dental AI requires many X-rays.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:09.620
But pooling them in one place is a risk.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:14.780
Dental Data reverses the path: the
algorithm travels to each practice,

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:19.300
learns there and returns only what it
learned, never the images.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:22.100
The computations use
confidential computing,

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:24.940
which protects the data while they
are being processed.

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.900
The first model, for
interproximal caries and

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:31.380
periodontal bone loss, is in
clinical validation.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:35.940
It is an aid for the professional: it does
not replace their diagnosis.

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.620
And it is getting ready for what comes
next: in two thousand thirty-one,

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:44.660
medical images enter the European
Health Data Space.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:47.470
The algorithm goes to the data.
